NOTE appended by hand 2026-10-02.  This file is a generated artifact; the note is
not, and it is here so the line it names cannot be quoted.

  The line "E_err/N  clean 0.022792021" above is WRONG.  The script computed
  T.std(ddof=1)/sqrt(n) * sqrt(tau_int(T + kappa*V)) -- T's naive error on the mean
  times the SQUARE ROOT OF E's tau, i.e. two different sequences multiplied
  together.  It is not an estimator of anything, and its agreement in order of
  magnitude with the frozen column was a coincidence.  The script is fixed.

  The authoritative, corrected numbers are in logs/regress_a8_liquid.log (part 4),
  and scripts/regress_a8_liquid.py supersedes this script: it drives the same
  production path and, under the frozen campaign's own tau rule, reproduces the
  record's E_err and E_err_naive exactly.

  Every other number above stands.  In particular the "E/N (k rec)" row is the
  kappa residual and it is the reason section D exists: at the record's rounded
  kappa 53.033 the clean walk reproduces E/N to 1.41e-10, while at the clean
  physical kappa 53.03300858899106 the difference is 6.40e-06 per electron.
